{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e1c2bfe29f7bd3eee153fe2b3540af0815e97500dec56f3eb77fc658201a5f82", "ja": "美也、お疲れさま。\n新しい衣装、気に入ってくれたかな？", "zh": "美也，辛苦了。\n喜欢新衣服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "16efbcf5844dda3efbbf6cbda2dd94fae3e673c49184f71f50ab60c2720154d4", "ja": "はい～。とってもかわいいですし、\nとっても動きやすいんですよ～。", "zh": "是的～。非常可爱，而且活动起来也特别方便呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "54dc50f126d19ebd2e8cdd89f2d9dc1015bd06bbc20a51437c8e7ea7cd9f0864", "ja": "私が本物の雪だるまでも、この衣装を着せて\nもらえたら、踊りだしてしまうかもしれません～。", "zh": "就算我是真正的雪人，穿上这套衣服，说不定也会忍不住跳起舞来呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2f595369064590e9689f21db7b16459df8ae829b577cd0b01ae67d67345de906", "ja": "それはちょっと見てみたいな……。\nとにかく、喜んでもらえてよかった。", "zh": "那还真有点想看看……  \n总之，你能喜欢真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "69ea70bc69c2120a460ed5e911f1c3c369ac5f498a4e3b3dd256e073f8754bed", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。このまま家に\n帰ってしまいたいくらい、嬉しいです～。", "zh": "谢谢您～。开心得我都想\n直接回家去了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f685e2fb72120d5436dcd018b42eef7da601d76fe509945fc679b0cf22cf4cf7", "ja": "それはちょっと困るな……。ちゃんとファンのみんなに\nかわいい美也を見てもらわないと。", "zh": "那可有点伤脑筋……得让所有粉丝好好看看可爱的美也才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "6409280edb610566449b7fb571e19ca3a3fff4e5f90d63ec1dd8d00e9f0f1fc1", "ja": "お～。そんなふうに言ってもらえると、\nなんだか照れますな～。むふふ♪", "zh": "哦～你这么说，我都有点害羞了～。唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "8ceb6551c2113a7d09fa4d4c99566021f3ff7d093152fa93b2d76f9021f591b3", "ja": "顔も身体も、ポカポカしてきちゃいました。\n雪だるまだったら、溶けてしまいます～。", "zh": "脸和身体都暖呼呼的了。要是雪人的话，可就要融化了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1008_p", "source_sha256": "17be8c9aff642a73c0d65b2385201f948cc5ca131ef2da83d990e4007c8d5f6d", "ja": "あはは、それも困るな。美也が溶けちゃう前に\n公演に出られるよう、急いで準備を進めるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，那样也很伤脑筋啊。在美也融化之前，我会抓紧准备，争取让她能登台演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "7602140a775692e0aca3819f6adb540982a1e84a187e6cb50838a9751a4e47fe", "ja": "よろしくお願いしますね～。\nあ、でも……。", "zh": "那就拜托你啦～。\n啊，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "8ad02bac0c6a9841fec3037af2b7ce56977ae06cd97ca391ea1df4a9f05ba018", "ja": "溶けてしまっても、\n大丈夫かもしれません～♪", "zh": "就算融化了，\n也许也没关系哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1011_p", "source_sha256": "15740ff342169da9decab73849d546aff041678161b7e28e16a2619a6cd1db56", "ja": "……えっ、そうか？\n全然大丈夫じゃない気がするけど……？", "zh": "……诶，是这样吗？\n我觉得完全没问题啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "29c3b6b5b2d19f2a892783beaf744d52d34ad1c06f795a659bf4bec3d6e16647", "ja": "雪だるまは溶けてしまっても、\n雪が積もれば、また作ってもらえますからね～。", "zh": "就算雪人融化了，只要积起雪来，就又能重新堆一个了嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "823d992e95c743e9d01bcade326efa1bddacb003763565f80ba879e68966e920", "ja": "雪が降るたびに、ファンのみなさんと会える……。\nそういうのも、とっても素敵な気がします～♪", "zh": "每次下雪都能和各位粉丝见面……能有这样的感觉，我觉得也特别棒呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4185f03dd766a0ee77a47ba65d6fc057db7644a1336189547b832b5e06ae6e01", "ja": "なるほど。雪が降ったら美也に会える……\nうん、たしかに素敵だな。", "zh": "原来如此。下雪的话就能见到美也……\n嗯，确实很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1015_p", "source_sha256": "aab4b87bf472fe838bdb04ad321e32b817e7818f0c429175ac9f67c6b55099aa", "ja": "でも、雪が降らないと会えないっていうのは、\nやっぱり寂しくないか？", "zh": "不过，如果不下雪就见不到她，\n果然还是会觉得寂寞吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "44d1e646d665805d71dc5eb44dbbf9f0b501cdc15bf1a76393f39115d5c7242b", "ja": "……お～。よく考えたら、そうかもしれません……。", "zh": "……噢～仔细想想，或许真的是这样呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "32676625cf00a76c8f304f2c5e8d9fe54ba81710cd74afd16915f3fd371ad4d9", "ja": "では、やっぱりこの衣装は、\n大事に大事に着ることにしますね～。", "zh": "那么，果然还是要把这件服装好好珍惜着穿呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "3c48aa279821c8f469518583edb2c2560047ec319c0a5c5b2fd983e56c1b17ad", "ja": "いつでもみなさんと会えるように。\n溶けない雪だるまを目指して、頑張ります～♪", "zh": "为了能随时和大家见面，\n我会以成为不会融化的雪人为目标，加油努力的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0134_1019_p", "source_sha256": "bc5d64424e258ac021daace90532e5cc82ecadfbabf68592e1b3d3afdd27647d", "ja": "（きちんと手入れしておこう。きっと誰よりも\nあたたかい日差しが似合う雪だるまだしな！）", "zh": "（好好打理一下吧。毕竟它一定比谁都适合温暖的阳光！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
